"entity": {
"name": "TKH Group NV",
"description": "TKH Group NV engages in the development and delivery of systems and networks for the provision of information, telecommunication, electro technical engineering, and industrial production. It operates through the following segments: Smart Vision Systems, Smart Manufacturing Systems, Smart Connectivity Systems, and Other. The Smart Vision systems segment provides two-dimensional and three-dimensional machine vision and security vision systems. The Smart Manufacturing systems segment serves industries from tire production for cars and trucks to factory automation and medicine distribution. The Smart Connectivity systems segment produces cable systems for industrial automation applications. It also operates through the following geographical segments: Netherlands, Europe, Asia, North America, and Other. The company was founded in 1930 and is headquartered in Haaksbergen, the Netherlands.",
